store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030210/extras/f16f90cff512c412a7080299454bd99c.avif?t=1729616511\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pets Are Back</h2>Fight your way to fame and glory with your loyal companion! Add skills and equip them with gear to make them stronger. Each species comes in a myriad of colors and styles, so make sure to collect them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030210/extras/442bb4d387257400e60fd8491dea5a2d.avif?t=1729616511\" /></div></h2>",
